  "notes": [
    "Same two states render the same list in both arms; the user-visible delta is the address bar and what survives a refresh.",
    "before arm: clicking 关注 leaves location.search empty and a reload falls back to 动态 (3 cards).",
    "after arm: clicking 关注 writes ?feed=following and a reload restores 关注 with 1 card.",
    "before arm: /discover?feed=following is HTTP 400 \"Queries not supported\" (settings_page.py whitelist); after arm: HTTP 200.",
    "Theme is switched through the page own appearance control (#appearance-toggle -> POST /v1/settings), not injected CSS."
  ],
